Z||000047||Ken Wittlief||06-15-2001||11:56 PM||||Im not saying its all one way or the other - statistics take the big picture into account - your individual situation will be what you and your husband decide to make it.<P>  The biggest factor in all of lifes endevour isnt where you start out from, or what you start with<P>   its taking what you have now, and starting from where you are now, and making the best of it.<P>  the more you undestand about interpersonal relationships, what things add to or detract from a sucessful marriage, the better you will do.||||reg||1
