Z||000074||poupas||06-21-2001||04:24 PM||||   I want to add my beliefs here. It is not intended to offend anyone it is just what I personally think.<BR>   I like sex, I like sex alot. I have sex with people I know, with people I dont know, I have sex with people I like and I have sex with people I dont like. I have some relationships with girls where it is only sex. If one of us is feeling horny we will call each other. I always use protection, it is safe sex. Having sex with someone different means having a different kind of sex, it is not the same with everyone. <BR>   Waiting for marriage I dont really understand. For people that are engaged you have already devoted yourselves to each other. Why wait? Really no offense to anyone, this is just the way I think.<BR>   Everone has heard of meaningless sex, why is it meaningless, you have fulfilled a desire. That is meaning. I have lots of desires in life I try to fulfill them all.<BR>  <P>  About the Fierosex fetish, just imagine you and your mate getting the urges while you are driving, stop and park for awhile. Have sex somewhere other than the bedroom. It breaks up routine and is alot of fun.<BR>   <BR>  ||||reg||1
