Z||000076||Ken Wittlief||06-21-2001||05:12 PM||||engagement is a agreement or intention to make a commitment - you are still free to back out if you chose.<P>  Otherwise, whats the point of the marriage thing, is it only a big party after the engagement?<P>   there were guys back when I was a teenager that had these cheapo diamond rings, and they would get engaged to some sappy chick for a few weeks, or a month or so, and employ your logic (we are getting married baby - why wait) and then dump her and move on to someone else - literally engaged several times a year.<P>  Its amazing how many girls fell for it.||||reg||1
