Z||000085||Ken Wittlief||06-22-2001||11:58 AM||||children are the reference point for what a marriage is:<P> Marriage - sex - children<P>  in its pure sense, you cant back out of a marriage anymore than you can un-conceive a child.<P>  You can abort a child, you can time share a child, you can take a knife and slice the child in half (thats how I felt when my parents divorced) but you cant un-born a child.<P>   and you cant un-marry someone. All you can do is kill the marriage.<P>  not intenting to sound harsh to anyone that is divorced. My main point is: if you walk up to the alter thinking "If it doesnt work out we can always get a divorce" then what you are about do enter into is not a marriage - I dont know what it is.||||reg||1
