Z||000129||FieroHeather||06-27-2001||12:46 AM||||Hey 87 Pegasus!  Thanks for your input  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>My fiancee and I are really excited about spending our lives together as a couple--and I am *always* thinking about his wellbeing...sometimes more above my own (just ask him)!  It was Ken's and Bam-Bam's comments that prompted the "concern for his and I's wellbeing" part.  I dont want to do something that would jeprodize this special relationship, like moving in with him too early.  It is the wise that listen to advice, but a foolish man is one who does not.<P>As for being in school and living with someone--he's at work from 7am to like 5 to 7pm at night, so there is a LOT of time during the day to get my homework stuff done.  I work the best for school during the morning  hours (5am to 11am), and read best in the early evening hours.  So Im not worried--there's always the library or kicking him over to BanditBalz's place for a couple of hours!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>I am also VERY ready to move out of my parents house *again*.  Ive been on my own for 3.5 years while in College, and I moved back home in December'00 to save money for school.  Im craving my own place reeeeeeal bad.<P>So, now that all of my personal info has been splattered across the internet, I shall go to sleep--tis been a loooong day!  Goodnight!||||reg||1
