Z||000146||87 Pegasus||07-02-2001||01:58 AM||||[QUOTE]Originally posted by Her86GT:<BR>[B]I do believe my final statement was that "sex shouldn't be expected after the first kiss". . .this implies that you wait a while to get to know the person you're with.  I never really dated too much before my husband so I can't relate to having multiple partners to deal with in my mind but rushing sex is definaltely NOT recommended - we waited eight months!  B]<P>My girlfriend and i waited i think three months but we both wanted it...  but the thing was i also have not had many partners and i truly love her and i know that we both could not have waited til we get married because she is 21 and i am 22 we have a ways to go...  but i will marry her...  i just think that if you wait til you get married it will change the relationship alot...  because you will always be thinking is it better with another...  so it is like testing the seas...  but don't test with out protection.  <P><P>------------------<BR>Friends don't let friends drive Corvettes!!||||reg||1
